    "rich_text_3xN7yt": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_hE6hrc": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "SCIENCE BEHIND OUR INGREDIENTS",
            "heading_size": 30,
            "heading_size_mb": 30,
            "heading_line_height": 1,
            "heading_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "text_qbVQMF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>\nAt B’spoke, every ingredient is chosen with precision and purpose. Our formulations use clinically studied nutrients that support your health at a cellular level.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nBelow is the science that guides our most trusted products.\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p><strong>Omega-3 (Algal EPA/DHA)</strong></p>\n\n<p>\nOmega-3 fatty acids support heart, brain, joint, eye and inflammatory balance. Vegan algal sources provide pure, sustainable EPA/DHA without contaminants.\n</p>\n\n<p><strong>What the science says:</strong></p>\n\n<p>\nReduces inflammation markers such as CRP, IL-6<br>\nCalder PC, Nutrients, 2010<br>\n<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21248803/\">https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21248803/</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\nSupports cardiovascular health and lowers triglycerides<br>\nBalk EM et al., Atherosclerosis, 2006<br>\n<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16785040/\">https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16785040/</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\nSupports tear hydration and reduces dry-eye symptoms<br>\nBhargava R et al., CLAE, 2015<br>\n<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25444695/\">https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25444695/</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p><strong>Prebiotic Fiber (Inulin & FOS)</strong></p>\n\n<p>\nThese plant fibres fuel beneficial gut bacteria, support digestion, and help stabilize post-meal glucose response.\n</p>\n\n<p><strong>What the science says:</strong></p>\n\n<p>\nSelectively increases Bifidobacteria in the gut<br>\nKolida & Gibson, J Nutr, 2007<br>\n<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17311984/\">https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17311984/</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\nClinically proven to improve bowel regularity<br>\nEFSA Journal, 2014<br>\n<a href=\"https://efsa.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.2903/j.efsa.2014.3483\">\nhttps://efs</a></p>",
            "text_size": 16,
            "text_line_height": 1,
            "margin_top_text": 20,
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "text_width": "800px"
          }
        }
      },
